00:14:20.180 --> 00:14:23.870
you can watch them there and everybody
you'll get this as a handout, as well.

00:14:23.870 --> 00:14:29.090
And so, we'll start with the first one,
and let me get this up.

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:32.790
