01:22:36.910 --> 01:22:39.740
So, I remembered another story that
grabbed my interest as a youth.

01:22:41.000 --> 01:22:41.540
Schroedinger's cat.

01:22:41.540 --> 01:22:45.990
It was a thought experiment that
Schroedinger used to explain the concept

01:22:45.990 --> 01:22:47.420
