01:22:47.420 --> 01:22:50.890
And in the story, the cat was both
alive and dead at the same time.

01:22:51.900 --> 01:22:55.430
So that gave me the idea for
a fun and engaging website name where

01:22:56.700 --> 01:22:59.340
